  "question": {
    "text": "$\\lim _{n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{\\sqrt{\\left(n^{3}\\right)}}+\\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{\\sqrt{(n+4)^{3}}}+\\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{\\sqrt{(n+8)^{3}}}+\\cdots \\cdots \\cdots+\\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{\\sqrt{[n+4(n-1)]^{3}}}$ is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{5-\\sqrt{5}}{10}$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{5+\\sqrt{5}}{10}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{2+\\sqrt{3}}{2}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{2-\\sqrt{3}}{2}$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\lim _{n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\sum_{r=0}^{n-1} \\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{\\sqrt{(n+4 r)^{3}}}$\r\n$=\\sum_{r=0}^{n-1} \\frac{1}{n}\\left(\\frac{n \\sqrt{n}}{\\sqrt{(n+4 r)^{3}}}\\right)$\r\n$=\\sum_{r=0}^{n-1} \\frac{1}{n}\\left(\\frac{1}{\\left(1+\\frac{4 r}{n}\\right)^{3 / 2}}\\right)$\r\n$=\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{d x}{(1+4 x)^{3 / 2}}$\r\n$=\\frac{1}{4} \\int_{1}^{5} \\frac{d z}{z^{3 / 2}}=\\left(1 / 4\\left(\\frac{-2}{\\sqrt{z}}\\right)\\right)_{1}^{5}=\\frac{5-\\sqrt{5}}{10}$"
  }
}